#: pervius/config.py:24 data/com.solvetus.Pervius.metainfo.xml.in:31
msgid "Pervius is an independent open-source project by Solvetus Labs. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Namecheap, Inc. FastVPN is a trademark of Namecheap, Inc."
